  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e04-scene-04",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "新たなエロの形を探してる  (Searching for a New Form)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chu": "チュウ",
    "kawada": "川田",
    "keieisha": "経営者"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Meanwhile, Kawada is adrift after losing his entire staff to Muranishi. At a strip theater, he tells a rival video Proprietor that ordinary productions no longer excite him at all, just as Chu turns up.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "私はどうしようもない男なんです。自分一人じゃなーんにもできない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "誰の支えにもなっていない。社員全員に逃げられたただの豚なんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "新たなエロの形を探してるんですけど、まだ試行錯誤の最中です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "普通にビデオ作ったらいいんじゃないの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もうたくさんですよ。飽きました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "なあ、売れる傾向教えてやろうか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "大ヒットとまではいかなくても、これやっときゃ間違いねえってヤツ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう普通じゃ僕、興奮できないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "お疲れさまです、社長！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "おお、来てたのか、チュウさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "またいいヤツ持ってきたんですよ。お運びしますので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "いいよ運ばなくて。もうしつこいよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "私はどうしようもない男なんです。自分一人じゃなーんにもできない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a hopeless man. All by myself I cannot do a single thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "誰の支えにもなっていない。社員全員に逃げられたただの豚なんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm no support to anyone—just a pig whose entire staff ran out on him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "新たなエロの形を探してるんですけど、まだ試行錯誤の最中です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm searching for a new form of erotica, though I'm still in the middle of trial and error.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "普通にビデオ作ったらいいんじゃないの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why not just make ordinary videos?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もうたくさんですよ。飽きました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I've had more than enough of those. I'm tired of them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "なあ、売れる傾向教えてやろうか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, want me to tell you the formula that sells?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "大ヒットとまではいかなくても、これやっときゃ間違いねえってヤツ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if it won't be a mega-hit, it's a surefire bet if you stick to it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう普通じゃ僕、興奮できないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With ordinary stuff, I just can't get excited anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "お疲れさまです、社長！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good evening, President!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "おお、来てたのか、チュウさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, so you're here too, Mr. Chu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chu",
      "t": "またいいヤツ持ってきたんですよ。お運びしますので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I brought another great item for you. Allow me to carry it to your place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "いいよ運ばなくて。もうしつこいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to bring anything. Quit being so pushy.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
